msgid "Plan queue"
msgstr "Queue planen"

#: src/ntasker/app.py:525
msgid ""
"Let an agent order the queue: it reads the open tasks, sets the run order"
" and starts the queue. It plans only -- the queue does the work."
msgstr ""
"Einen Agenten die Queue reihen lassen: Er liest die offenen Tasks, legt "
"die Reihenfolge fest und startet die Queue. Er plant nur -- gearbeitet "
"wird in der Queue."

